<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed} from 'vue';import {exhibitionOpeningChoices,exhibitionOpeningChoice,setExhibitionOpeningChoice,openingKindLabels,openingWeekdays,operatingLabel,exhibitionOpeningApplies} from '../../shared/place-opening';import type {ExhibitionOpeningChoice} from '../../shared/place-opening';import type {StudioPlace} from './content-studio-api';
const props=defineProps<{place:StudioPlace}>(),schedule=computed(()=>props.place.openingSchedule!);
const choice=computed({get:()=>exhibitionOpeningChoice(props.place),set:value=>{if(value)setExhibitionOpeningChoice(props.place,value as ExhibitionOpeningChoice);}});
</script>
<template><section v-if="exhibitionOpeningApplies(place)" class="studio-opening-fields"><h3>开放情况</h3><label>开放情况<select v-model="choice" aria-label="开放情况"><option disabled value="">尚未设置，请核实</option><option v-for="(label,key) in exhibitionOpeningChoices" :key="key" :value="key">{{label.zh}}</option></select></label><p>正常开放不代表每天开放或现在营业；周末开放不推断节假日安排。</p>
<details><summary>高级：开放时段、补充说明与核实</summary><p>保留记录：{{operatingLabel(place.publicStatus,'zh')}} · {{openingKindLabels[schedule.kind].zh}} · {{schedule.confirmed?'已有核实标记':'需要重新核实'}}。旧记录不自动转换为新的开放情况；请依据事实选择。</p><p v-if="schedule.weekdays.length">原记录星期：{{openingWeekdays.filter(d=>schedule.weekdays.includes(d.id)).map(d=>d.zh).join('、')}}</p><div class="form-grid"><label>开放时段（中文，选填）<input v-model="schedule.hours.zh" placeholder="不确定时留空"></label><label>Opening hours（English，选填）<input v-model="schedule.hours.en"></label><label class="wide">补充说明（中文）<textarea v-model="schedule.notes.zh" placeholder="尚未建成、节假日、临时闭馆、预约要求等"></textarea></label><label class="wide">Additional notes（English，选填）<textarea v-model="schedule.notes.en"></textarea></label><label>信息来源（中文）<input v-model="schedule.source.zh"></label><label>Source（English，选填）<input v-model="schedule.source.en"></label><label>开放安排最后核实日期<input v-model="schedule.lastVerifiedAt" type="date"></label></div><p>核实日期由您填写，不使用编辑或保存日期。暂未开放时，游客端不显示旧开放时段；资料仍保留。</p></details></section></template>
